<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">For workspace positioning, see <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="https://www.safeworkaustralia.gov.au/sites/default/files/2023-07/workstation-set-up_infographic_july2023.pdf">Safe Work Australia’s workstation set-up guidance</a>. For a monitor arm or mount, follow the manufacturer’s instructions for the exact model and screen.</p>
